    "line_closure": "iso_create.cpp assigns special Ly-alpha, Doppler-core CRD to other Lyman lines, and CRD with wings to subordinate lines. rt_line_one.cpp/iso_level.cpp use escape, destruction and continuum pumping. The native full-J CRD slab is a different closure.",
